diagrams.mermaid:
flowchart TD
  S([Sync starts]) --> AU{Drive authenticated?}
  AU -- no --> X[Stop: not authenticated]
  AU -- yes --> L[List folder, cached 60s]
  L --> F{Supported type?}
  F -- no --> SK[Skip]
  F -- yes --> W{Modified in last 90 days?}
  W -- no --> OUT[Outside date range]
  W -- yes --> C{Same modifiedTime as last sync?}
  C -- yes --> UTD[Up to date]
  C -- no --> P[Process: new or updated]
  P --> I[Index all new chunks]
  I --> ST[(Save sync state)]
